# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Chao Jiang et al. (2024). Machine learning potential assisted exploration of complex defect potential energy surfaces.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-024-01207-8
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 3fdae7408d330697...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
