# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/jiang2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the n2p2 Behler-Parrinello NNP for ThO2 (two hidden
# layers of 21 neurons; radial and angular cutoffs 10 and 6 A) trained
# on LDA data of defected fluorite supercells, voids, liquids and AIMD
# snapshots (3,672 energies, 3,521,988 force components), with the
# stated energy and force RMS deviation. Ground-state searches, cluster
# expansion and binding energies are properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
